<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>GoDeadlock - Tag - loommii</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/en/tags/godeadlock/</link><description>我的个人技术博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.165.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 16 Jan 2026 01:28:43 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://loommii.github.io/en/tags/godeadlock/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Go Daily Question 20250530</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_20250530/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 May 2025 15:26:33 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_20250530/</guid><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category><description>&lt;p&gt;What is the output of the following code?&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#10;&#10;import &amp;#34;sync&amp;#34;&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10;&#9;var wg sync.WaitGroup&#10;&#9;foo := make(chan int)&#10;&#9;bar := make(chan int)&#10;&#9;wg.Add(1)&#10;&#9;go func() {&#10;&#9;&#9;defer wg.Done()&#10;&#9;&#9;select {&#10;&#9;&#9;case foo &amp;lt;- &amp;lt;-bar:&#10;&#9;&#9;default:&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;println(&amp;#34;default&amp;#34;)&#10;&#9;&#9;}&#10;&#9;}()&#10;&#9;wg.Wait()&#10;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;details&gt;&#10; &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#10; &lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="correct-answer-deadlock-no-output-program-hangs"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Correct Answer: &lt;strong&gt;Deadlock (no output, program hangs)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#correct-answer-deadlock-no-output-program-hangs" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="analysis"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Analysis:&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#analysis" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;This code will &lt;strong&gt;deadlock&lt;/strong&gt;; it will not output &amp;ldquo;default&amp;rdquo; nor panic. Instead, the program will hang and cannot continue execution. The reasons are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Go Daily Question 150</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_150/</link><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jan 2025 13:55:19 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_150/</guid><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category><description>&lt;p&gt;What is the output of the following code?&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#10;&#10;import (&#10; &amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&#10; &amp;#34;time&amp;#34;&#10;)&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10; ch1 := make(chan int)&#10; go fmt.Println(&amp;lt;-ch1)&#10; ch1 &amp;lt;- 5&#10; time.Sleep(1 * time.Second)&#10;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;A: 5&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;B: Cannot compile&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;C: Runtime deadlock&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;details&gt;&#10; &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;C &lt;a href="https://go.dev/play/p/FsQsswPtOpp" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;Run online&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;fatal error: all goroutines are asleep - deadlock!&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Official description of &lt;a href="https://go.dev/ref/spec#Go_statements" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;Go statements&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;A &lt;code&gt;go&lt;/code&gt; statement starts a new goroutine (concurrent thread of execution) and executes a function call in that goroutine.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Go Daily Question 060</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_060/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 20:44:41 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_060/</guid><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category><description>&lt;p&gt;What is the output of the following code?&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#10;&#10;import (&#10; &amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&#10; &amp;#34;time&amp;#34;&#10;)&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10; ch1 := make(chan int)&#10; go fmt.Println(&amp;lt;-ch1)&#10; ch1 &amp;lt;- 5&#10; time.Sleep(1 * time.Second)&#10;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;A: 5, B: Cannot compile; C: Runtime deadlock&#10;&#10;&lt;details&gt;&#10; &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;C&#10;Analysis: Because &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;-ch1&lt;/code&gt; is a parameter, it can be understood that it needs to be evaluated to get a result before creating the goroutine. Therefore, it leads to a runtime deadlock. It should be modified as follows:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>